{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"twofaced-paralytic-elk","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Purpose\nDurable register of parentless open bugs whose rebar-debug investigation reaches the not-a-bug or design-choice escalation bar. Keep unresolved decisions here so the operator can resolve them together without losing root-cause context. Each bug retains its detailed evidence and RCA on its own ticket.\n\n## Pending decisions\n- `stumpy-cinnabar-basenji` — choose the `run_in_worker` callable contract. Recommended: fork only in single-threaded hosts; spawn in multithreaded hosts; convert spawn/pickling failures to the existing fail-open result. Alternative: preserve arbitrary callable execution in multithreaded hosts, which requires a larger serialization/worker design. Background prior-art and rebar payload research is in progress.\n\n## Resolved during sweep\n- `dragonish-sylphic-sheep` — preserve Chat Completions with `openai-chat:`; future Responses migration tracked by `upbeat-illadvised-springtail`.\n- `novel-unwasteful-stonefly` — user authorized broad typed validation, including enum and non-enum coercion, for this bug.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every unresolved not-a-bug or design-choice escalation from the sweep is listed with the exact decision required.\n- [ ] Each listed bug is linked with `relates_to` and holds its evidence on the source ticket.\n- [ ] Operator decisions move entries from Pending to Resolved with the chosen contract recorded.","id":"9c72-c44a-3421-45ad","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["debug-sweep","decision-register"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Decision register for parentless bug debug sweep"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787018409098124001,"uuid":"fb0a1380-d465-4346-8262-45b357a888d1"}